      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10926/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir cake mix, oil, and eggs together in a large bowl until it comes together as a dough.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BAxSjvZVCx3LRqE7aaDPTGHtA0A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10926-Cake-Mix-Cookies-DDMFS-Step-2-0451-3d311a0ea16a4b959a7e66055e28ffb4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10926/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Form dough into 1-inch balls and place 2 inches apart on ungreased baking sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Kze9gF_aveDpTi19IcLYozWPUJE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10926-Cake-Mix-Cookies-DDMFS-Step-3-0449-0830173ca0cf4c8094728f02eb3e01f2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10926/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven, about 6 to 10 minutes, depending on how soft you like your cookies. Cool cookies on the baking sheet for 5 minutes before transferring them to a wire rack to cool completely.",
